% treecol_tallbox: as treecol_pixels, in a box of 3 BoxSize in z that is periodic in x and y only
InitCondFile                snapshot
OutputDir                   output
TimeBegin                   0
TimeMax                     1e-3
BoxSize                     40.0
TimeBetSnapshot             1e-3
MaxSizeTimestep             1e-4
DesNumNgb                   32
UnitLength_in_cm            3.085678e+18
UnitMass_in_g               1.989e+33
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s    100000
MinGasTemp                  10
DomainBuild_ActiveFraction  0.5
CritPhysDensity             1e30
SfEffPerFreeFall            0.01
StellarTablesFile           SET_BY_TEST
SGChemTablesPath            SET_BY_TEST
SGChemCosmicRayIonRate      2.0e-16
SGChemDustToGasRatio        1.0
SGChemDeuteriumAbundance    2.6e-5
SGChemG0                    0
SGChemG0_LW                 0
SofteningGas                0.01
SofteningHalo               0.01
SofteningDisk               0.01
SofteningBulge              0.01
SofteningStars              0.01
SofteningBndry              0.01
TreeColShieldingLength      8
% DEVELOPER_MODE (the test sets ErrTolForceAcc): the values a build without it forces
ErrTolTheta                 0.7
ErrTolForceAcc              0.0025
ErrTolIntAccuracy           0.02
CourantFac                  0.4
MaxRMSDisplacementFac       0.25
MaxNumNgbDeviation          1
ResubmitOn                  0
ResubmitCommand             none
TimeBetStatistics           1e-3
